<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Hi, I&#8217;m Mohamed</h2>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">Mohamed Elber is the founder of Daily Space Hacks. Based in Morocco, he has always loved organizing spaces, especially small ones, and started this blog to share practical, budget-friendly storage ideas for small homes, apartments and rentals. He plans every guide, uses AI tools to help research and write it, and makes sure each one is fact-checked against trusted sources before it is published.</p>



